<header><h3>{sid} · {esc(scene['label'])}</h3><span class="num">{fr(shot['start'])} à {fr(shot['end'])} s · images {frames(shot['start'])} à {frames(shot['end'])} · {frames(shot['end']) - frames(shot['start'])} images</span><span class="swatch" style="background:{tint}" title="teinte du plan {tint}"></span></header>
